      attribution: "Andries Pauli (named on the object), portrait of Luís de Camões, etching and engraving, 1610-1639, Rijksmuseum, Amsterdam, RP-P-1964-507 (public domain). A posthumous engraving (Camões died in 1580) that its caption presents as a true likeness commissioned by Gaspar Severim de Faria: a later depiction, not a lifetime likeness, and no securely authenticated lifetime portrait is established in the sources read.",
      attributionUrl: "https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/en/collection/RP-P-1964-507",
