      licenseUrl: "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/",
      attribution: "Unnamed photographer; frontispiece of W. P. Livingstone, Mary Slessor of Calabar (Hodder and Stoughton, 1915), Internet Archive scan from Princeton Theological Seminary Library (cropped and downscaled).",
