      attribution: "Studio portrait of Phan Châu Trinh by the Khánh Ký studio, Saigon (imprint partly legible), before April 1926; scan via Wikimedia Commons (cropped and reduced). First publication: cover of Phan-Châu-Trinh lịch-sử: Quốc gia huyết lệ (Saigon: Thịnh-Quang, 1926), Bibliothèque nationale de France.",
      attributionUrl: "https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k4236248g",
