      // [src_qian_galcit, src_qian_lv, src_qian_britannica | 1936-1955 | department history, institutional biography, reference biography] His research moved from aerodynamics and thin-shell theory to rocket propulsion, engineering cybernetics and physical mechanics (Caltech, 2023 biography), the biography adds that during the years of restriction he worked on games and economic behaviour, and it documents serious activity in music, design and photography. Most of the scientific range lies within engineering mechanics, and the arts material comes from one biography. CONCENTRATION CHECK (agent): lowered from 74 / 0.58 to 72 / 0.54 because the non-science range rests on a single institutional biography.
      cross_domain_range: [72, 0.54, "s", "A"],
      // [src_qian_lv | 1930-1935 | institutional biography] At Jiaotong University he played the euphonium in the orchestra and brass band, was listed in several student music groups, designed the graduation emblem and album cover for his class, and learned photography with a Rolleiflex camera; before leaving for the United States he published three music reviews arguing that music should be judged by its content and emotional expression, and the biography quotes a classmate's recollection of listening to records with him. The episodes are specific and distinct but all come from one admiring biography. CONCENTRATION CHECK (agent): lowered from 72 / 0.54 to 66 / 0.46 because only one source family documents these interests.
