      source: "Photograph of Satoshi Omura at a Nobel-week event in Stockholm, taken 6 December 2015 (EXIF capture time 15:14:27) by Bengt Nyman and published by him on Wikimedia Commons as 'Satoshi Omura 5040-2015.jpg' (own work). Downloaded at the original 3161 x 3161 pixels and downscaled to 1000 x 1000; no cropping beyond the original frame, no upscaling. Sitter checked against the Commons description ('Satoshi Omura Nobel Laureate in medicine in Stockholm December 2015'), the Wikidata depicts statement, the Nobel Prize 2015 category and the capture date, and visually against the Japan Academy official member portrait (same face, glasses and ears); there is no lettering in the image.",
